{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id892595342"}, "name":{"label":"JulianneRCB"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-10-17T15:26:23-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.8.2"}, "id":{"label":"11845292483"}, "title":{"label":"Much love to the whole team ❤️"}, "content":{"label":"This app makes my life so much easier. It helps me manage my time, focus and, most importantly, manage the stress I usually feel due to a long to do list. It has helped me reclaim my time, both for productivity and leisure AND manage my energy levels which is so important as I am chronically ill. Sending my thanks and lots of love towards the whole team, I am so thankful this app exists.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id1476564879"}, "name":{"label":"toatbe"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-10-16T09:30:28-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.8.2"}, "id":{"label":"11840857818"}, "title":{"label":"Would be 5 star if the widgets came back"}, "content":{"label":"I purchased this app because I loved the way it works and how convenient the widgets were, now after some update either to my phone or the app itself I can’t access widgets, which again was a main reason I purchased the app to begin with……no help offered through online support, just instructed to restart phone, update app, delete and reinstall app, I’ve done it all. No widgets.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id1710957798"}, "name":{"label":"John Macinnis"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-10-14T08:56:35-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.8.2"}, "id":{"label":"11833554087"}, "title":{"label":"Awful"}, "content":{"label":"It’s too cluttered and to navigate is annoying I hate the modernization of apps like just make it simple like 90s websites no glam or glow just what you need. Add emojis!? How do I change the name of the task lol, and then the ad on the planner itself?? Thank you for everything!!! Amazing app", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id1389370670"}, "name":{"label":"CharulSDadhe"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-10-10T14:07:35-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.8.2"}, "id":{"label":"11819489633"}, "title":{"label":"Structured - Daily Planner"}, "content":{"label":"I don’t know what I would do without Structured. I like I can view what tasks I have for a day. Keying in reminders/tasks is super easy and I love the UI too - there is so much customization  you can do. I use the paid subscription  - that is how much I love this app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id17190578"}, "name":{"label":"Seamus D Dog"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-10-08T04:06:03-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.8.0"}, "id":{"label":"11810645446"}, "title":{"label":"Get widgets working"}, "content":{"label":"I’m quite disappointed. Read a lot of positive reviews, and loved the widgets. Provided viewable well designed summaries of days tasks, and bought the app. But every time I update these widgets go blurry and fail to show any information. There is a technical note about it, and I’ve tried all three fixes, only to have the problems come back after each update (of my day). I really hope they fix these widgets, but that they have a note that doesn’t work does not really inspire a lot of confidence.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id1177244729"}, "name":{"label":"SorryNotSorry321"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-10-03T21:00:37-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.7.3"}, "id":{"label":"11794960827"}, "title":{"label":"Amazing app to plan out events"}, "content":{"label":"I have discovered this app and downloaded it on all my devices. It's so amazing and simple (you can choose the meter of simplicity) and satisfying to cross out the tasks once you've completed them. Free, but also has a pro version. Even allows financially unsecure people ask for a scholarship for the pro version. \nEXTREMELY RECOMMENDED!!!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
