{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id149651741"}, "name":{"label":"bytecraze"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-09-26T19:08:46-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.7.3"}, "id":{"label":"11768707046"}, "title":{"label":"iCloud Sync Not Working"}, "content":{"label":"The mac app fails to sync with iCloud Sync while the iOS app is able to, and after turning iCloud off for the mac app and back on, all the tasks / events are duplicated. Had to uninstall it since it’s not reliable / usable like this. Another issue I noticed is that the UI seems to have pretty bad performance, it takes 1-2 seconds when I try to tick something off or try to edit a task, not sure why.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id101020435"}, "name":{"label":"Mers Saghafi"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-09-26T17:23:02-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.7.3"}, "id":{"label":"11768454441"}, "title":{"label":"Doesn’t update accordingly"}, "content":{"label":"I have ADHD and saw so many people raving about this app so I gave the free trial a shot and liked it. I decided to get the $20 for the whole year which I thought initially was a decent price so I just bought it. \n\nNot even two weeks after purchasing the yearly plan, it stopped updating in real time with my calendar (took almost half a day for my Structured to match my calendar) I tried everything and it turns out that this is just how it is. The app support said Sometimes it just takes “a while”, well over 9 hours of waiting won’t help me. I also don’t like the fact that you can’t edit calendar blocks within the Structured app, it redirect you back to the calendar to edit in that. I decided I needed an app with better coding so I tried to get a refund for this issue and the developer refused. Now I’m stuck paying for an app that I won’t use.\n\n I do not recommend buying the yearly plan unless you 1000% know you want it.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id543488786"}, "name":{"label":"Malum Caedo"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-09-26T14:14:15-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.7.3"}, "id":{"label":"11768017260"}, "title":{"label":"Great App, Very Useable as Free"}, "content":{"label":"This app has been great and I’ve been using it for a while now. Its not perfect by any means but most if my issues are simple bugs which are probably equally the fault of how bad iphones are in general. \n\nIts so good I am seriously considering upgrading via the lifetime option. Which is amazing to have at all btw. So sick of everything insisting it needs a subscription when most things just dont need them. Too many of these kinds of apps feel like its just a money addicted team looking to make something easy and simple with no maintenance so they can trick people into a monthly subscription. Structured feels like a team who set out to create a tool, which still needs some refining, to help people plan their days and be more organized and productive. In doing so they ask a fairly reasonable price and even offer a one-time purchase option which is becoming more and more rare.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
